<body>

    <h1>Tourist Attraction Gallery</h1>

    <div class="gallery">

        <div class="card">
            <img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gps-cs-s/AHRPTWlPivBCPKaA0EsZD43_kVrqWqULnWGLRx3I0_Hvg-cNS6zYTP-iFhasa6O9D4lXoYXS6bvrhT_-4_vtJC6zvhg2qW96NP8aVUHMQgUtn659gW7OQZXOfUM99HtJUPX0jfvMZw6alw=s680-w680-h510" alt="Honda Bay">
            <h2>Honda Bay</h2>
            <p>
                A premier island-hopping destination dotted with white-sand islets, pristine coral reefs, and vibrant marine life perfect for snorkeling and swimming.
            </p>
            <p><strong>Location:</strong> Barangay Sta. Lourdes, Puerto Princesa City, Palawan</p>
            <button>View Details</button>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQhFCuvOj6xbfNGCJwzsisVtHRMTyOCkC-sQgG1pUij6SyLW7BwwGpcYr1-&s=10" alt="Baker's Hill">
            <h2>Baker's Hill</h2>
            <p>
                A charming hilltop garden park famous for its freshly baked hopia and pastries, themed statues, dining spots, and family-friendly recreation areas.
            </p>
            <p><strong>Location:</strong> Barangay Santa Monica, Puerto Princesa City, Palawan</p>
            <button>View Details</button>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQyB8QCXoWd75pRebyo9JW-KM0G1Km_-LWG8Jf24hN9zrOP3pfXvwU0-LoM&s=10" alt="Balayong People's Park">
            <h2>Balayong People's Park</h2>
            <p>
                A scenic public park lined with native Palawan cherry trees (Balayong), featuring recreational spaces, walking paths, and sports facilities.
            </p>
            <p><strong>Location:</strong> Barangay San Pedro, Puerto Princesa City, Palawan</p>
            <button>View Details</button>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <img src="https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/11/2b/c4/e1/main-entrance-to-plaza.jpg?w=1200&h=-1&s=1" alt="Plaza Cuartel">
            <h2>Plaza Cuartel</h2>
            <p>
                A historical open-air memorial park served as a WWII military garrison and the site of the 1944 Palawan Massacre.
            </p>
            <p><strong>Location:</strong> Barangay Liwanag, Puerto Princesa City, Palawan</p>
            <button>View Details</button>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQpRUcC-Z09VejWfK_UIyPUg2qCf0UQWxsU2HQsJz55kw8JOJkO5a1KJR4&s=10" alt="Mitra's Ranch">
            <h2>Mitra's Ranch</h2>
            <p>
                A sprawling hilltop property offering panoramic views of Honda Bay, lush green lawns, horseback riding, ziplining, and outdoor relaxation.
            </p>
            <p><strong>Location:</strong> Barangay Santa Monica, Puerto Princesa City, Palawan</p>
            <button>View Details</button>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>Underground River</h2>
            <img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTD5eaPuHTaYoBqlURZyvhAI1INxIDtE0GY8SD40hVO803nYm6TRFZgKCYl&s=10" alt="Puerto Princesa Underground River">
            <p>
                A UNESCO World Heritage Site and New7Wonders of Nature featuring an 8.2-kilometer navigable subterranean river flowing through a spectacular limestone karst cave system into the sea.
            </p>
            <p><strong>Location:</strong> Barangay Cabayugan, Puerto Princesa City, Palawan</p>
            <button>View Details</button>
        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
